WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.000
[THE EUROPEAN BATTERY ALLIANCE]

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.480
[TURNS 5 THIS YEAR]

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.800
[STILL TAKING BABY STEPS]

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.200
[OR GROWING UP FASTER
THAN EXPECTED?]

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.280
We have seen far more
than baby steps.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:16.160
Five years ago, the EU battery industry
was hardly on the map.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:22.920
Today, Europe is a global battery hotspot
with 127 billion euros in investment

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.240
and some 111 industrial projects
emerging across our Member States.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.360
And we keep moving forward.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.100
[WHAT OBJECTIVE]

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.800
[IS DRIVING YOU FORWARD?]

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:41.000
To see Europe among
the global leaders in e-mobility,

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:44.360
an essential part of the green
and digital economy.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.880
We are well on track
to produce enough batteries

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.960
for 11 million cars a year
by 2030.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.160
If we can maintain this momentum,

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.040
I am sure we will achieve
strategic autonomy

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.120
in the battery sector.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.100
[HOW CAN YOU KEEP]

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:03.400
[YOUR MOMENTUM GOING]

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:07.200
[IN 2022?]

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.480
First, it is high time

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.360
to adopt the proposed
batteries regulation,

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.700
setting high
sustainability requirements

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.400
for batteries placed
onto the EU market.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:23.440
Second, we all have to put our backs
into securing battery raw materials.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:24.640
And third,

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:27.360
I want to see
our European Battery Academy

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:29.640
expanding across
more Member States,

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:32.720
to prepare our workforce
for this fast-growing sector.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:33.760
So stay tuned!

